    "description": "Layout for ASM exposures validated by Tenzai. The Alert Info tab groups case details, the Tenzai verdict, affected asset/service, remediation, timeline and closing into scannable sections; the Validate tab carries the Start/Re-validate actions and the Tenzai results panel (verdict hero, facts row, per-severity bar, and an expandable list of confirmed findings that open inline to their impact/assessment, linking to the full reproduction and fix guidance in Tenzai)."
